  "content": "<p>這是《戰士世界》的擴充模組，新增了自訂武士盔甲與武士刀武器。同時也加入了有助於獲取生存模式內容的新合成配方。<br>此外，還包含來自 Epic Fight Mod 的動畫效果。</p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://discord.gg/EMYfNytN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>！！！DC 群組！！！</span></a></span></p><p>依賴與支援版本如下：<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">- 點擊各項即可直接下載 -</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">- <a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod/download/6145747\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a></span><br><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">- <a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-resurrection/download/6472836\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight：復甦</a></span><br><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">- <a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight/download/5889471\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇蹟武器</a></span></p><p>盔甲展示圖片：</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\">紅色武士盔甲</span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_945bd417-cdf8-4bbe-8571-ab08655e5e9a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"484\" height=\"433\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">黃色武士盔甲</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_81c5311d-2097-4a6a-a288-c605d565ca43.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"489\" height=\"497\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">藍色武士盔甲</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7fc70d54-ce41-41f7-b2b9-d556b910b699.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"487\" height=\"472\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">黑色武士盔甲</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_52a5385c-1c8c-4277-a285-e89f2b2e57c3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"487\" height=\"532\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">暗影武士盔甲</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1289060/description_de08bbcb-2e0a-46ea-8e55-aab0f4e484f5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"487\" height=\"548\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">浪人盔甲</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1289060/description_c0d35dea-3e7b-44b5-89bc-13a071d81867.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"488\" height=\"570\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">黑色浪人盔甲</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1289060/description_720d6461-2f79-4e43-ab0d-9a71f1ba1de8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"490\" height=\"517\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
